  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nIn <b>Chiral</b>, a sci-fi psychological horror/comedy first person puzzle game, where you’ll assume the role of a disembodied brain in a jar, paired with a digital AI companion. Together, you’ll navigate a labyrinth of mirror, laser, and gravity puzzles that will challenge your spatial reasoning.<p></p>\n<p>After a “routine” brain transfer procedure, you find yourself in a jar, but don’t worry – you’ll still be a valuable asset to the corporation! As you traverse the eerie and captivating levels, you’ll encounter mind-bending spatial puzzles and corrupted robotic managers.</p>\n<p>Enter <b>Chiral</b> and embrace the madness. Your brain will never be the same again.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Spatial Puzzles: Test your intellect with complex mirror, laser, and gravity challenges.\n</li><li>Dark Humor: Enjoy a storyline infused with a creepy yet comedic tone.\n</li><li>Unique Mechanics: Utilize your ability to cross through mirrors, manipulate objects, alter gravity, and more.\n</li><li>Atmospheric World: Immerse yourself in the unsettlingly delightful corporate dystopia with a brutalist foundation sprinkled with some cartoony augmented reality.\n</li></ul>\n",
